  "privacyDataCollectionHeading": "1. Data we collect",
  "privacyDataCollectionBody": "When you use the app, we may collect personal information such as your name, email address, and education level, as well as usage data such as your activity in the app, the subjects you view, and your sign-in and sign-out times, to improve the service and user experience.",
  "privacyDataUsageHeading": "2. How we use your data",
  "privacyDataUsageBody": "We use the data we collect to improve content quality, tailor lessons and tests to your needs, send educational notifications, and contact you when needed. We also use some data for analytics to improve the app's performance and stability.",
  "privacyDataProtectionHeading": "3. Protecting your information",
  "privacyDataProtectionBody": "We are committed to protecting your personal information using encryption and secure storage, and we restrict access to your data within the system. However, complete protection cannot be guaranteed in a digital environment, so we advise users to be cautious when sharing information.",
  "privacyDataSharingHeading": "4. Sharing data with third parties",
  "privacyDataSharingBody": "We do not sell or rent your personal data to any third party. We may share some data with trusted partners only to operate the service, such as for performance analysis, subject to full confidentiality and privacy protection, or when required by law.",
  "privacyUserRightsHeading": "5. User rights",
  "privacyUserRightsBody": "You have the right to access your data, update it, or request its permanent deletion from our servers. You can contact the support team within the app with any privacy-related request, and we will process it within 7 business days.",
  "termsAcceptanceHeading": "1. Acceptance of terms",
  "termsAcceptanceBody": "By using this app, you acknowledge that you have read and understood these terms and agree to comply with them in full. If you do not agree, please do not use the app. The app's management reserves the right to amend these terms at any time, and you will be notified of updates when necessary.",
  "termsAccountUsageHeading": "2. Creating and using an account",
  "termsAccountUsageBody": "Some app features require a personal account with accurate information, such as your name and email address. You must keep your sign-in details confidential and not share them with others. Any unauthorized use of the account is a violation that may lead to its suspension.",
  "termsAcceptableUseHeading": "3. Acceptable use",
  "termsAcceptableUseBody": "You must not use the app for unlawful purposes, violate others' rights, or cause harm to the app or other users. This includes posting offensive content, copying videos or summaries without permission, or attempting to breach the app's security.",
  "termsIntellectualPropertyHeading": "4. Intellectual property rights",
  "termsIntellectualPropertyBody": "All content available in the app, including videos, summaries, tests, and designs, is protected by copyright and trademark laws. You may not use or republish any of these materials without prior written consent from the app's management or the content owner.",
  "termsServiceSuspensionHeading": "5. Suspension of the service or account",
